This _static/README includes information on using static objects within the top-level directory of the Vera C. Rubin Observatory Risk Management Tool User Guide.

To use static files, add the file (png, svg or jpeg preferred for images) to this _static directory.
The reST syntax for adding the image from the top-level directory is:

.. figure:: _static/filename.ext
    :name: fig-label
    :target: http://target.link/url

    Caption text.

See README for RTN-051 for details on contributing to the document project.
